your first love again since then.

751
00:48:19,875 --> 00:48:21,833
Do you still have feelings for her?

752
00:48:27,083 --> 00:48:28,708
I don't even have the right

753
00:48:30,083 --> 00:48:31,500
to have those feelings.

754
00:48:33,041 --> 00:48:34,583
Don't have the right?

755
00:48:42,666 --> 00:48:43,750
No, I don't.

756
00:48:44,875 --> 00:48:47,041
I don't have the right to love anyone.

757
00:48:51,000 --> 00:48:52,833
Can't even imagine

758
00:48:54,250 --> 00:48:56,083
myself having sex.

759
00:49:01,541 --> 00:49:04,125
The reason I became a sex therapist…

760
00:49:11,041 --> 00:49:13,208
is because I can't stand sex.
